{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054670/extras/1debd1ae80f3998be7d6fd96c26a48e5.avif?t=1759428645\" width=1529 height=887 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinity Mask</strong> is a stylized third-person action-adventure that blends fast-paced combat, platforming, puzzle-solving, and rich storytelling in a world shaped by Norse mythology. Set after the fall of Ragnar\u00f6k, the game invites players into a broken yet mysterious world\u2014full of secrets, ancient ruins, and mechanical remnants of lost civilizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054670/extras/4d4cc1cb3cb92c89cbf1d40b3e60f719.poster.avif?t=1759428645\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054670/extras/4d4cc1cb3cb92c89cbf1d40b3e60f719.webm?t=1759428645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054670/extras/4d4cc1cb3cb92c89cbf1d40b3e60f719.mp4?t=1759428645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Embla</strong>, an <strong>Andromen</strong>\u2014a hybrid being born from machine and human soul. Awakened without memories, you must explore vast biomes, uncover hidden temples, and reconstruct a forgotten past to understand the power of the Infinity Mask.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054670/extras/997010b357159a1ea1250b3aea61748f.poster.avif?t=1759428645\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054670/extras/997010b357159a1ea1250b3aea61748f.webm?t=1759428645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054670/extras/997010b357159a1ea1250b3aea61748f.mp4?t=1759428645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The demo of ASHGARD: Infinity Mask includes the following content:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prologue / Tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many hidden chests and secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic combat system with the first weapon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic platforming system and introduction to puzzle mechanics</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054670?t=1759428645","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054670?t=1759428645","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054670/05d5c4fd47844e8d92d96f45cc07634a8d689cb0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759428645","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054670/05d5c4fd47844e8d92d96f45cc07634a8d689cb0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759428645","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragrap